// Renovate, for this repository.
//
// One line, because there is nothing here to except. Everything general - when
// updates arrive, what groups with what, what may merge itself - lives in
// Lautstark/.github and names no package.
//
// This package depends on idb and on nothing pinned by tag, so the two
// exceptions the family carries elsewhere - the github:-pinned @lautstark/*
// packages, and onnxruntime-web - have no dependency here to apply to. It is
// itself one of the packages the three apps pin that way, which is the reason
// it is worth having this file at all: what it ships is the standing backup,
// and a dependency of it moving unattended is worth the same Monday morning
// look as anything else in the family.
//
// The .json5 is spelled out on purpose: the //path/to/file syntax implies a
// .json extension, so omitting it looks for a file that is not there and
// Renovate stops before it does anything. The shorter "owner/repo:name" form
// implies it too.
{
  $schema: "https://docs.renovatebot.com/renovate-schema.json",
  extends: ["github>Lautstark/.github//renovate-shared.json5"],
}
